9. Integration With Beast System 3.0
The Treasury integrates with:

beast-system-3-core — identity & authority

beast-system-3-schemas — financial data schemas

beast-system-3-workflows — automated treasury workflows

beast-system-3-modules — agent‑level financial modules

beast-system-3-interfaces — cross‑repo contract boundaries

This ensures full interoperability across the entire system.

